<!DOCTYPE html>
{{!--
  Zahlungserinnerung (scs-zahlungserinnerung) – Seeclub Stäfa
  Informal reminder, no QR-bill slip; fee line only when feesTotal is not 0.00.
  Layout, logo and typography follow the Zahlungsbestätigung. Context (buildReminderPayload in
  apps/functions/src/invoice/reminder-payload.logic.ts): heading (= template name), invoiceId, invoiceTitle,
  invoiceDate, reminderDate, dueDate (DD.MM.YYYY), greeting, firstName, lastName, streetName, streetNumber,
  zipCode, city, totalAmount, feesTotal, paidTotal, amountDue, qrMessage, plus payee.* resolved server-side.
  payee.iban may be the QR-IBAN (QR reference only); a plain transfer goes to payee.regularIban.
--}}
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  :root {
    --ink: #1a1a1a;
    --muted: #555555;
    --accent: #1d70b8;      /* title blue */
    --margin: 25mm;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  body {
    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.45;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    print-color-adjust: exact;
  }

  .page {
    position: relative;
    width: 210mm;
    min-height: 297mm;
    padding: 20mm var(--margin) 28mm var(--margin);
  }

  /* ---- Header: logo left, sender block right ---- */
  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .logo {
    width: 42mm;
    height: auto;
  }

  .sender-block {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.4;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ---- Recipient address (window position) ---- */
  .address {
    margin-top: 22mm;
    margin-left: 95mm;
  }

  .address .return-line {
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    text-decoration: underline;
    margin-bottom: 6mm;
  }

  .address .recipient div {
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  /* ---- Body ---- */
  .title {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 17pt;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-top: 18mm;
    margin-bottom: 7mm;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 4mm 0;
  }

  .greeting {
    margin-bottom: 5mm;
  }

  /* ---- Label / value rows ---- */
  .field {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 2mm;
  }

  .field .label {
    width: 42mm;
    flex: 0 0 42mm;
  }

  .fields {
    margin-bottom: 5mm;
  }

  /* ---- Positions ---- */
  .positions {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 6mm;
  }

  .positions td { padding: 1.2mm 0; vertical-align: top; }
  .positions .pos-desc { font-size: 8.5pt; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.5mm; }
  .positions td.amount { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; padding-left: 6mm; width: 35mm; }
  .positions tr.total td { border-top: 0.3mm solid var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .positions tr.subtotal td { border-top: 0.2mm solid var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .positions tr.page-break { break-after: page; }
  .positions tr.page-break td { padding: 0; }
  .positions tr { break-inside: avoid; }

  .closing {
    margin-top: 7mm;
  }

  .signature {
    margin-top: 5mm;
  }

  /* ---- Footer pinned to bottom margin ---- */
  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--margin);
    right: var(--margin);
    bottom: 12mm;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    font-size: 9pt;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .footer .right {
    text-align: right;
  }

  .footer a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">

    <header class="header">
      <img class="logo" src="https://bkaiser.imgix.net/tenant/scs/logo/scs-wordmark.png" alt="Seeclub Stäfa">
      <div class="sender-block">
        {{payee.name}}<br>
        {{payee.zip}} {{payee.city}}
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="address">
      <div class="return-line">{{payee.name}}, {{payee.zip}} {{payee.city}}</div>
      <div class="recipient">
        <div>{{firstName}} {{lastName}}</div>
        <div>{{streetName}} {{streetNumber}}</div>
        <div>{{zipCode}} {{city}}</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h1 class="title">
      {{heading}}<br>
      Rechnung {{invoiceId}}
    </h1>

    <p class="greeting">{{greeting}},</p>

    <p>Vielleicht ist unsere Rechnung untergegangen. Das kann passieren. Wir erinnern dich deshalb freundlich an die offene Zahlung und freuen uns, wenn du sie bis zum {{dueDate}} erledigst.</p>

    <div class="fields">
      <div class="field">
        <div class="label">Datum:</div>
        <div class="value">{{reminderDate}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="field">
        <div class="label">Zahlbar bis:</div>
        <div class="value">{{dueDate}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <table class="positions">
      <tr><td>Rechnung {{invoiceId}} vom {{invoiceDate}}<div class="pos-desc">{{invoiceTitle}}</div></td><td class="amount">CHF {{totalAmount}}</td></tr>
      {{#ifEquals feesTotal "0.00"}}{{else}}<tr><td>Mahngebühren</td><td class="amount">CHF {{feesTotal}}</td></tr>{{/ifEquals}}
      <tr><td>bereits bezahlt</td><td class="amount">CHF {{paidTotal}}</td></tr>
      <tr class="total"><td>Offener Betrag</td><td class="amount">CHF {{amountDue}}</td></tr>
    </table>

    <p>Bitte überweise den offenen Betrag bis zum {{dueDate}} auf das Konto von {{payee.name}}.{{#if payee.regularIban}} IBAN: {{formatIban payee.regularIban}}.{{/if}} Gib dabei «Rechnung {{invoiceId}}» an. Falls du inzwischen bezahlt hast, betrachte dieses Schreiben als gegenstandslos.</p>

    <p class="closing">Herzlichen Dank und freundliche Grüsse</p>

    <div class="signature">
      <div>Bruno Kaiser, Kassier</div>
      <div>{{payee.name}}</div>
    </div>

    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="left">{{formatIban payee.regularIban}}</div>
      <div class="right">
        079 790 8929<br>
        <a href="mailto:bruno@seeclub.org">bruno@seeclub.org</a>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
